          <a href="/en/export-delivery/" class="process-link">Export Delivery →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <div class="step-num">06</div>
          <h4>Export Delivery & Installation Guidance</h4>
          <p>Export documentation, sea freight and overseas installation technical guidance</p>
          <a href="/en/export-delivery/" class="process-link">Installation Guidance →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 09 Roof & Wall Systems -->
  <section class="detail-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading reveal">
        <p class="section-index">09 / Roof & Wall Systems</p>
        <h2>Roof and Wall Cladding Systems</h2>
        <p>The enclosure system of a warehouse directly affects storage environment and operational cost. ZhongSai can supply roof panels, wall panels and supporting cladding materials per project requirements, coordinated with the primary steel structure.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="image-text-block reverse">
        <div class="itb-image">
          <img src="/images/products/detail-cladding-system.jpg" alt="Steel warehouse roof and wall cladding systems" loading="lazy">
        </div>
        <div class="itb-content">
          <h3>Cladding Configuration Determined Per Storage Environment</h3>
          <p>Roof and wall materials, thermal insulation, waterproofing grade and ventilation configuration are determined based on storage use, local climate and project technical requirements.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Roof and wall panel systems can be supplied together with the primary structure</li>
            <li>Thermal insulation layers configured per storage environment and project requirements</li>
            <li>Roof waterproofing and drainage details designed per project technical requirements</li>
            <li>Natural ventilation and lighting openings arranged per storage needs</li>
          </ul>
          <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
            <a href="/en/components/roof-wall-cladding-systems/" class="btn btn-outline">View Cladding Systems</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

