            <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <div class="faq-answer-inner">
              Steel components are marked, packed and loaded into shipping containers for ocean freight. Packing is organized by component type and container loading requirements to maximize container utilization and prevent shipping damage. We provide export documentation support and can coordinate logistics. The number of containers required depends on building size, component dimensions and packing configuration.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
            <span>Do you provide local construction?</span>
            <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <div class="faq-answer-inner">
              ZhongSai provides design/detailing, fabrication, export supply and technical installation guidance. Local civil works and construction are normally handled by local contractors. We can provide installation drawings, component identification systems, bolt tightening specifications and remote technical support to assist your local team. On-site technical guidance can be arranged based on project requirements. We do not act as a local general contractor or EPC contractor unless a specific written agreement states otherwise.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
