            <div class="faq-answer-inner">
              Yes. You can first provide storage use, basic dimensions, racking requirements and loading needs. ZhongSai can conduct initial needs assessment and confirm what is needed for proposal and quotation. However, accurate pricing requires complete drawings and technical specifications.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
